{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/pulls/2","id":5011823840,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVXP_H88AAAABKrpc4A","html_url":"https://github.com/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/pull/2","diff_url":"https://github.com/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/pull/2.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/pull/2.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/issues/2","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/pulls/2/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/pulls/2/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/issues/2/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/statuses/deb85d9f27441b275ab8b108f0232ecd2707a1e8","number":2,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"阶段2：原生失败恢复与数据证据审计，云端联调失败待统一验收","user":{"login":"wwooyy429","id":80371541,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwMzcxNTQx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80371541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429","html_url":"https://github.com/wwooyy429","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"阶段2新增真实任务链此前缺少严格的 worker 诊断、Research 原生失败恢复和数据来源核验。本批补齐这些软件模块，并完成一次有界云端联调；真实 Research 在历史来源迭代时抛出 CollectionError，底层原因未暴露，尚未得到 Research→LEAN 成功证据。因此本 PR 保持草稿、未合并，阶段2整体仍未验收通过。\n\n## 固定审核版本与入口\n\n- 当前统一审核源码：`deb85d9f27441b275ab8b108f0232ecd2707a1e8`。\n- [统一 GPT Work 审核指令](https://github.com/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/blob/deb85d9f27441b275ab8b108f0232ecd2707a1e8/audit/review_packages/stage2_completion_runtime/REVIEW_INSTRUCTIONS.md)\n- [本轮执行及剩余缺口报告](https://github.com/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/blob/deb85d9f27441b275ab8b108f0232ecd2707a1e8/audit/stage2_completion_round_report.json)、[当前验收状态](https://github.com/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/blob/deb85d9f27441b275ab8b108f0232ecd2707a1e8/audit/stage2_current_readiness.json)\n- [第一批开发证据包](https://github.com/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/blob/deb85d9f27441b275ab8b108f0232ecd2707a1e8/audit/review_packages/stage2_completion/README.md)、[原生失败及修复补充包](https://github.com/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/blob/deb85d9f27441b275ab8b108f0232ecd2707a1e8/audit/review_packages/stage2_completion_runtime/README.md)\n- 先读取 AGENTS.md、config/development.json、研究章程、预算、数据字典及全部既往审核。旧66ff72f批准仅适用于该版本独立测试覆盖范围，不延伸到本次新增实现。\n\n## 实现与真实执行\n\n1. 增加受限 worker 字节/格式/AST 诊断与严格提取；保留既有严格哈希及 EOF 边界。\n2. 固定 Research cell 的部署位置、原始输入、项目、源码和实际 read_cell 回执绑定；跨进程一次执行许可，未知结果禁止自动重跑。\n3. 增加 Research 原生失败及原 attempt 恢复；真实返回的两个相同 MCP 文本载体记为一次失败，保留完整原件哈希。全局原生解析器及成功协议未放宽。\n4. 增加 Cloud 内的数据证据审计和私有输入复核；观测自洽不等于供应商真实性或完整数据认证。\n\n实际部署/执行源码为 `7fc5ef2e9d2379d29f48d05a1f3cc760000884d6`。31个受管文件上传、编译及源码读回一致，但随后的 Research 运行失败。当前交付包含看到真实回执后的受限解析修补，**此最终控制器版本未在云端执行**，不能将先前读回/编译结果归给当前源码。\n\n[原始失败回执](https://github.com/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/blob/deb85d9f27441b275ab8b108f0232ecd2707a1e8/audit/tool_observations/f5d05f5b964b4a1d924e4b70cd207386-research.json)；[原任务结算](https://github.com/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/blob/deb85d9f27441b275ab8b108f0232ecd2707a1e8/audit/stage2_completion_reconciliation.json)。实际 Research attempt：`f5d05f5b964b4a1d924e4b70cd207386`。原任务已结算 failed，未提交新 LEAN。没有成功工程报告，History 调用数、收到的数据条数、订单及财务统计均未知，不能填0。\n\n## 验证和证据边界\n\n- 本地 `python -B tools/research.py build` 与 `python -B tools/stages.py verify` 成功，612项合成测试通过（75.908秒）；离线验证没有访问市场数据或提交回测。\n- [GitHub 固定版本离线检查](https://github.com/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/actions/runs/40493506432)已完成，Python 3.10、3.11两个任务均成功；这是工程检查，不能替代独立验收。\n- 两个开发包共163份原字节证据已按清单复核。补充探针与仓库套件有重叠，不能累加为独立测试总数。\n- 隔离账本验证15→17→17的失败恢复；当前真实账本17事件，旧13事件前缀不变，失败不退额度。\n- G1：真实 Research 失败，依赖 LEAN 未准入，成功链路仍缺失。\n- G2：诊断软件已实现，旧 LEAN worker 实际源码差异仍证据不足。\n- G3：已有真实原生失败及原任务失败恢复，新增软件待独立验收。\n- G4：历史 US200、财务版本和实际送达/摄入等完整数据认证仍证据不足。\n\n## 预算和停止条件\n\n全局累计配置 **7/12**、Research **10/20**、LEAN **1/16**。本次仅新增1次真实 Research、0次 LEAN，未购买资源。当前工程轮累计配置2、Research2、LEAN1，已达到配置/Research预登记停止条件；本 PR 不授权继续提交、自动重试或修改限额。\n\n正式因子研究、自动 GPT 调用、交易和最终测试继续关闭。2024–2025已暴露、2026独立性未知的事实保留。本轮结果仅是工程证据，不构成因子金融有效性或阶段3–7验收。\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-26T04:02:16Z","updated_at":"2026-10-27T11:09:08Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"fb3a04b004b7786a017c2d12fa8be9e69ed8954b","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"wwooyy429:feat/stage2-data-task-bridge","ref":"feat/stage2-data-task-bridge","repo":{"id":1433665311,"node_id":"R_kgDOVXP_Hw","name":"AQRP-LLM","full_name":"wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM","owner":{"login":"wwooyy429","id":80371541,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwMzcxNTQx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80371541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429","html_url":"https://github.com/wwooyy429","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/